      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I want this feature, even knowing people in the VRC clubbing scene would just use it to cancel each other, \"oh you're friends with this person I don't like? blocked\" etc. I think overall it'd be worth adding though. Add an opt-out toggle though, please.",
